      "username": "Chief_Lackey_Rich",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-05-10T00:22:08.833Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I was re-listening to that episode (which is nearly two years old at this point) and at one point they get a question asking:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“Can we get links to the various “GTG people play the RPG” things to make catching up on their “canon until decided otherwise” events?”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>To which the response is:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>“Sure, check the show notes.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Which would be great, but when you check the show notes, it says:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>Can we get links to the various “GTG people play the RPG” things to make catching up on their “canon until decided otherwise” events? Sure, check the show notes.</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>And that’s it.  There are no links anywhere in the notes that I can see, and if the wiki has a big page of collected actual plays it’s eluding me.</p>\n<p>Anyone know where this info would be?</p>",
